    "sections": {
        "description": "The Fishery Services Theme is a multipurpose, modern, and fully responsive solution designed for fishery agencies, seafood suppliers, aquaculture farms, marine product sellers, and fishing equipment stores. It features a clean and minimal layout that adapts across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, ensuring consistent display and usability. Built with Bootstrap-based code, the theme supports stable performance and smooth functionality. It includes customization options such as flexible layouts, color settings, and typography controls, along with sections for banners, call-to-action buttons, testimonials, services, galleries, and team information. Social media integration and Contact Form 7 compatibility help manage user interaction and inquiries. The theme is also SEO-friendly and translation-ready, making it suitable for building accessible and functional websites for various marine and seafood-related businesses."
    },
